* **AI disclosure**: When posting messages, comments, issues, or any content to external services that will be read by humans (e.g., Slack messages, GitHub/GitLab comments, PR/MR descriptions, Discord messages, Linear/Jira issues, Notion pages, emails, etc.), always include a brief note indicating the content was generated by an AI agent on behalf of the user. For example, you could add a line like: _"This 
