Since I want to ensure we're using a particular version of Jackson, and to make this explicit within our own project's configuration, I've decided on a course of action. I will introduce a `<jackson-bom.version>` property directly into our root `pom.xml`. By setting this property to `3.1.7`, I intend to explicitly override the version that's currently being inherited from the Spring Boot parent. This should give us 
